{"id":"658059734","kind":"article","title":"间隔重复与打扫房间","author":"Issa Rice","original_authors":["Issa Rice"],"original_source_urls":["https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Spaced_repetition_and_cleaning_one's_room"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"Issawiki & Learning","date":"2023-09-24","updated":"2023-09-24","votes":9,"comment_count":1,"minutes":1,"chars":533,"keywords":["间隔重复","物理杂乱","注意力管理","行为提示","工作环境"],"summary":"作者把桌面凌乱比作未被提醒的复习：人会因误判某些书或草稿何时还会用到，而把它们一直留在手边。他设想间隔重复系统可适时提示整理或自动移走闲置物品，让清理环境变得柔和、自然。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/658059734","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"参见"},{"id":"sec-2","level":3,"title":"链接到本文"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"U_AvVZla\">我觉得<b>间隔重复和打扫房间</b>冥冥之中有种联系。</p><p data-pid=\"nGBUq0TU\">对于我现实中的周围环境，我常常会将我当前使用的书或草稿纸放在桌子上，但之后我就不再用这些东西了，因为我转头去做其他事了。这时候，这些书/纸就成为了「也许会用」的东西，但我还想把他们留在桌子上，也许我马上又会用到呢（尽管大多数时候都没用到）。</p><p data-pid=\"9Udd-PLP\">我感觉，我一旦搞乱了我周围的环境，比如我的工作桌，我常常<b>想</b>留有一部分凌乱的源头，因为我觉得我可能还要用到某本书或某张纸。这时候，我犯的错不是犯懒（不过<b>某些</b>像脏盘子没洗这样的乱就完全是犯懒），而是对物件相关度的认知错误（具体而言，我未来什么时候还会用到某物）。所以这就是打扫房间和间隔重复的关联之处了——如果有一种间隔重复的方式来提示我，或者自动清理我不再使用的东西，这种方式是更加「柔和」、「自然」且「人性化」的处理凌乱周围环境的方法。</p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">参见</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"f0QsgBMG\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Physical_vs_digital_clutter\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">物理与数字的杂乱</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"pKE-x91G\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Spaced_repetition_as_soft_alarm_clock\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复充当软性闹钟</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"HAg5ztnX\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Spaced_repetition_world\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复的世界</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"aSDCv1G8\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Spaced_everything\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔一切</a><br/> </li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-2\">链接到本文</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"UhPfqZwQ\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Spaced_repetition_world\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复世界</a> (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=Spaced+repetition+world\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">←链接</a>)<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"u0eGg0e6\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Physical_vs_digital_clutter\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">物理与数字杂乱</a> (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=Physical+vs+digital+clutter\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">←链接</a>)<br/> </li></ul><blockquote data-pid=\"t8EuluCO\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者<span class=\"nolink\">S</span>hom、校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Spaced_repetition_and_cleaning_one's_room\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Spaced repetition and cleaning one's room</a></blockquote>","rec_chain":[{"id":"657926848","title":"管理学习中的微动作","author":"Issa Rice","votes":12,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"658395407","title":"数学中的组合爆炸","author":"Issa Rice","votes":13,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"1944442771533432041","title":"纠错练习","author":"Vipul","votes":8,"minutes":3,"reason":"跨学派视角 · Vipul"}],"rec_answers":[]}